    "sections": {
        "description": "PenBird is a powerful and flexible multipurpose WordPress theme. Designed to create virtually any type of website. With its versatile design, customizable layouts, and built-in theme options, PenBird provides everything you need to build a professional website that fits your vision. It includes customizable header and footer layouts, multiple footer widget areas, and extensive customization options through the WordPress Customizer. PenBird also offers seamless WooCommerce integration with beautifully styled shop, cart, and product pages, making it ready for eCommerce websites. The theme works independently without requiring any page builder, while Elementor and X Addons for Elementor are available as optional tools for enhanced design flexibility and advanced customization."
    },
